{"id":"en_flower-adornment-hidden-blade","title":"Flower Adornment, Hidden Blade","titleEn":"Flower Adornment, Hidden Blade","description":"A nobleman’s illegitimate son, long treated with contempt, takes on the guise of a fragile performer and vows never again to draw a blade, a promise made to shield his maltreated mother. That resolve is tested when a demonic fiend lays waste to the martial world. Abandoning his disguise, he draws his ancient sword and stuns onlookers with his strength. The question that remains is whether he can avenge his mother and bring down the ruthless family that humiliated him.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/flower-adornment-hidden-blade/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/flower-adornment-hidden-blade/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Karma Payback","Martial Arts","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldt2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_flower-adornment-hidden-blade_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldt2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_flower-adornment-hidden-blade_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldt2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_flower-adornment-hidden-blade_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldt2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_flower-adornment-hidden-blade_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldt2/?pub=4occak","